## What was replaced (2026-05-03)

The 4 DO droplets previously ran a 321-line Python `http.server` mock at `/opt/datachain-rope/rpc-server.py` that:
- Hardcoded `PEER_COUNT = 5`
- Computed `eth_blockNumber` as `(time.time() - START_TIME) // 5` — fake progression
- Returned identical mock data on all chain queries
- Used a different (unrelated) genesis hash `0xb8c6f33f1780d30977c5e964f62e7959102a3694f1c28ae0834ab12f98a3dcb0`

External wallet/exchange scanners were probing these public IPs (port 8545) and getting **fake responses**. This was a real production hazard — eliminated 2026-05-03 by stopping the mock services on all 4 droplets and replacing rpc-1 with a real follower node.

